@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create a todo
# @name create
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Try Herald" }

### Create an invalid todo (rejected by ValidationBehavior → 400)
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### List todos
GET {{host}}/todos

### Complete the todo (publishes TodoCompleted → 204)
POST {{host}}/todos/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/complete

### Completed count, updated by a notification handler
GET {{host}}/stats
